Synopsis UDINT CalcAlgorithm(System.Serial.Algorithm, ARRAY[*] OF BYTE, UDINT, UDINT) [Input] System.Serial.Algorithm kind;
[InOut] ARRAY[*] OF BYTE buffer;
[Input] UDINT offset;
